# Board topology 5 — an elevation spine with a broken pit trough beside it.
# The high ground column at x=4 is the best firing line on the board and the
# worst place to be standing: a Grappler prefers HighGround targets, and every
# other spine tile has a pit one step east.
#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot

id: tp-05-the-spine
number: 105
name: The Spine
description: A ridge worth plus one damage and a fall on either side. The whole enemy roster exists to take you off it.
retired: Duplicates `high-road` with more furniture; its Lobber takes zero actions in eight rounds.

spawn h = Husk
spawn g = Grappler
spawn s = Stalker
spawn l = Lobber

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

board:
  ......BBB
  ...^HO..g
  h...H....
  ...^HO.s.
  ....H....
  ..h.HO..l
  AAA......
